      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>MoveFlow 1.1</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Nudge overlay now shows Start button and countdown</li>
          <li>Snooze and skip controls available from first overlay</li>
          <li>Fix: overlay auto-dismisses after long absence</li>
          <li>Fix: timer credits time after recent break completion</li>
          <li>Fix: celebration and snooze task cleanup</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
